  m_text: 'WASD to move your character!

    Face an interactable object and press
    E to sabotage it!


    Your co-workers will walk around the office doing their
    job, when they interact with a sabotaged item, chaos ensues!


    Don''t let
    your co-workers see you doing sabotage!


    Sabotage all your co-workers in
    order to beat the level!


    Aim for the highest score!


'
